    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just grief though. grief implies there was something there to lose. but when i look at it now, it's like i've been building a cathedral out of smoke. i've spent my prime years chasing a ghost. if the core of it is just empty, then what am i supposed to do with the rest of my life? i just don't see the point in continuing the charade.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
